arc R2C2:PLC2 H00R0000 Q6
arc R2C2:PLC2 MUXCLK1 CLK0
arc R2C2:PLC2 MUXCLK2 CLK0
arc R2C2:PLC2 MUXCLK3 CLK0
arc R2C2:PLC2 V00B0000 Q4
arc R2C2:PLC2 V00T0000 Q2
arc R2C3:PLC2 A4 V00B0000
arc R2C3:PLC2 A5 Q5
arc R2C3:PLC2 A6 H00R0000
arc R2C3:PLC2 A7 Q7
arc R2C3:PLC2 B0 V00T0000
arc R2C3:PLC2 B1 Q1
arc R2C3:PLC2 B2 H01W0100
arc R2C3:PLC2 B3 Q3
arc R2C3:PLC2 CLK0 G_HPBX0000
arc R2C3:PLC2 F0 F0_SLICE
arc R2C3:PLC2 F1 F1_SLICE
arc R2C3:PLC2 F2 F2_SLICE
arc R2C3:PLC2 F3 F3_SLICE
